35,2,1,talk,Rin,,"@Midori, the truck roars at seven forty! And the gate-house filed eleven complaints! That’s why the corner feels hostile. We need a fix that stops the noise!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, the noise is real, but the money is the silent killer. We’re spending thirty-four thousand yen a year just on bags left open!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the noise is loud, but the silence between us is louder. The station block’s minutes show they’re already fighting over latches. We need a system that doesn’t require us to be friends.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"@Midori, thirty-four thousand yen is a lot, but my time is priceless! The supervised mornings are fifty minutes each, and we’d get twenty a year. That’s sixteen hours of my life gone!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"@May, sixteen hours is a symptom. The frontage data shows one house has a driveway blocking its bay, while another has only ninety centimetres. The layout is physically unequal.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, latches are a trap! I need a spot where the truck noise doesn’t wake me up. I’m checking the station block’s bin house to see if it’s actually quiet!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@May, sixteen hours is painful, but the ledger shows we’re bleeding money on open bags. I need to see if a proper shelter stops that waste.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, sixteen hours is a burden, but the residents' meeting showed nobody wants to be the gatekeeper. We need a system that doesn't force us to police each other.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, I agree! Nobody wants to be the gatekeeper. But sixteen hours is still a lot. I need to know if the filing process adds more hidden time to that burden!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@May, the filing process is rigid. A permanent build needs four months and five signatures. Any site change requires a new notice. We must choose the location correctly the first time.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, four months is forever! I just want the noise gone. If the station block’s bin house is quiet, I’m all for it!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Asuka, four months is a long wait, but the subsidy covers forty percent. I need to see if the station block’s setup actually stops the thirty-four thousand yen in waste.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, four months is a long time to be on edge. But the residents' meeting proved we can't even agree on who sweeps. We need a layout that removes the need for us to interact at all.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"@Asuka, four months is a nightmare! But the real trap is the twenty supervised mornings. I need a setup that doesn’t turn me into a part-time warden!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, removing interaction is impossible if the physical layout is unequal. One house is physically blocked. We must address the frontage disparity before discussing social dynamics.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,I’m done! I checked the truck time and the complaint log. The gate-house is the real problem! Let’s see the options!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,"I’m all set! I checked the ledger and the subsidy. We’re bleeding money, but the ward helps. Let’s see the options!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,I’m done. The station block’s minutes and the residents' meeting statements are clear. We need a system that doesn't force us to be friends. Let's see the options.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,I’m all set! I checked the filing requirements and the supervised mornings. Four months and sixteen hours of my life. Let’s see the options!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Asuka,,I have verified the frontage measurements and the filing requirements. The physical inequality is undeniable. Let us see the options.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
